<title>USA: Rhode Island Turnpike/Bridge repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Rhode Island Turnpike/Bridge repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Wednesday it repriced Rhode Island Turnpike/Bridge Authority's $43 million deal, lowering the top yield in 2017 to 5.45 percent from 5.50 percent, also lowering yields in the 2010 and 2011 maturities by two basis points each.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>RHODE ISLAND TURNPIKE AND BRIDGE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $42,870,000*</p>
<p>REFUNDING REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING OF THE 2010, 2011 AND 2017 MATURITIES.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: NAF		   S&amp;P: A		     FITCH: A</p>
<p>				   Confirmed		    Confirmed</p>
<p>DATED: 07/15/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 12/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 12/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>12/01/1998		1,335M    4.50  %    SEALED BID</p>
<p>12/01/1999		1,395M    5.00  %    SEALED BID</p>
<p>12/01/2000		1,465M    4.10  %	  4.20</p>
<p>12/01/2001		1,525M    4.20  %	  4.30</p>
<p>12/01/2002		1,585M    4.30  %	  4.40</p>
<p>12/01/2003		1,655M    4.40  %	  4.50</p>
